## Title: RareScanner (harness stand-in)
## Notes: Not RareScanner. A small stand-in for tools/harness/flow_rarescanner.py: a settings table, two pop-ups, the explorer's icon tooltips, the scanner button and two runtime lines, shaped like RareScanner's. It holds none of its English: the flow runs RareScanner's own libraries and enUS locale file from the installed addon first.
